Package: circaTE
Type: Package
Title: Paired Count and Temporal Models for Rhythmic Translational Efficiency
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Phil", "Zhang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "philzhang@tamu.edu")
Description: Fits fixed-period harmonic models to paired RNA sequencing and
    ribosome profiling counts. Provides joint quasi-likelihood count models,
    observation-precision weighted temporal generalized least squares,
    low-count diagnostics and explicitly simulation-only empirical calibration.
    Development software with conditional inference; does not establish
    endogenous circadian rhythmicity or universal false discovery control.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: edgeR (>= 4.4.0), limma (>= 3.62.0), statmod, stats, graphics, grDevices, utils, jsonlite, digest
Suggests: DESeq2 (>= 1.46.0), S4Vectors, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/zhangfei1947/circaTE
BugReports: https://github.com/zhangfei1947/circaTE/issues
